{
  "uid": "crm-realtime",
  "title": "Threadwise realtime: the loop behind the sockets",
  "description": "The API process read for the realtime question: loop delay and utilization, open handles, heap and GC. Socket-level counters do not exist yet (EL-B18).",
  "tags": [
    "threadwise",
    "event-loop",
    "realtime"
  ],
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "version": 1,
  "editable": true,
  "graphTooltip": 1,
  "refresh": "30s",
  "time": {
    "from": "now-6h",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "timepicker": {},
  "timezone": "utc",
  "templating": {
    "list": [
      {
        "name": "instance",
        "label": "Instance",
        "type": "query",
        "datasource": {
          "type": "prometheus",
          "uid": "crm-prometheus"
        },
        "definition": "label_values(crm_runtime_last_report_timestamp_seconds{service=\"api\"}, instance)",
        "query": {
          "query": "label_values(crm_runtime_last_report_timestamp_seconds{service=\"api\"}, instance)",
          "refId": "v",
          "qryType": 1
        },
        "refresh": 2,
        "sort": 1,
        "multi": true,
        "includeAll": true,
        "allValue": ".*",
        "current": {
          "text": "All",
          "value": "$__all"
        }
      }
    ]
  },
  "annotations": {
    "list": [
      {
        "builtIn": 1,
        "datasource": {
          "type": "grafana",
          "uid": "-- Grafana --"
        },
        "enable": true,
        "hide": true,
        "iconColor": "rgba(0, 211, 255, 1)",
        "name": "Annotations & Alerts",
        "type": "dashboard"
      }
    ]
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "What this dashboard covers",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 5,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "Sockets are served by the **API process** (`realtime.gateway.ts`, socket.io with the Redis adapter), so the realtime path shares the API loop. Everything here is that process, read for the realtime question: is the loop that fans messages out healthy, and how many handles does it hold.\n\n**Measured:** connected sockets, handshakes (accepted or refused), disconnects, room joins by result, events published by type with the rooms they fanned out to, publish failures, and the publisher's own cost per publish (the Redis sequence pipeline and the emit). **Still not measured:** delivery to a browser (the server cannot see a client receive a packet), Redis adapter lag, and the number of rooms."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "row",
      "title": "The loop that fans messages out",
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 5
      },
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Event loop delay",
      "description": "A delay here is a pause in every connected client’s updates.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "crm-prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 8,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 6
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "crm-prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "max(crm_event_loop_delay_p95_seconds{service=\"api\",instance=~\"$instance\"})",
          "legendFormat": "p95",
          "refId": "A"
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "crm-prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "max(crm_event_loop_delay_p99_seconds{service=\"api\",instance=~\"$instance\"})",
          "legendFormat": "p99",
          "refId": "B"
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "crm-prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "max(crm_event_loop_delay_max_seconds{service=\"api\",instance=~\"$instance\"})",
          "legendFormat": "max in window",
          "refId": "C"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s",
          "custom": {
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "fillOpacity": 8,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "spanNulls": false,
            "stacking": {
              "mode": "none"
            },
            "thresholdsStyle": {
              "mode": "line"
            }
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "orange",
                "value": 0.05
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 0.25
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
